{"id": "185847", "name": "מטריצת מעבר לבסיסים של תתי מרחבים", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "get_rand_2_mat", "params": ["n"], "body": "matrix([1,rand(2*n+1)-n],[0,1]) . transpose(matrix([1,rand(2*n+1)-n],[0,1]))"}, {"name": "get_rand_4_mat", "params": ["n"], "body": "matrix([1,rand(2*n+1)-n-1,rand(2*n+1)-n-1,rand(2*n+1)-n-1],[0,1,rand(2*n+1)-n-1,rand(2*n+1)-n-1],[0,0,1,rand(2*n+1)-n-1],[0,0,0,1]) . transpose(matrix([1,rand(2*n+1)-n-1,rand(2*n+1)-n-1,rand(2*n+1)-n-1],[0,1,rand(2*n+1)-n-1,rand(2*n+1)-n-1],[0,0,1,rand(2*n+1)-n-1],[0,0,0,1]))"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>יהי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(V=\\mathbb{R}^4\\)</span> ויהא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(U \\subseteq V\\)</span> תת-מרחב שבסיסו</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[B_1 = (u_1 = {{CT:0}}, u_2 = {{CT:1}}). \\]</p><p>כמו כן, נתון בסיס נוסף ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(U\\)</span>:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[B_2 = (v_1 = {{CT:2}}, v_2 = {{CT:3}}). \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>מצאו את מטריצת המעבר <span dir=\"ltr\">\\([I]^{B_1}_{B_2}\\)</span>:</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\([I]^{B_1}_{B_2}=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-grid\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: כל איבר בתיבה משלו: מספר, שבר (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">1/2</code>) או ביטוי (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(2)</code>).</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "trans_mat", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">יפה מאוד!</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובתך לא נכונה.<br><b>רמז:</b> למרות שהמרחב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(V\\)</span> הוא ממימד 4. מה צריכים להיות מימדי מטריצת המעבר?</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["base_mat", "trans_mat", "uvec1", "uvec2", "vec1", "vec2"], "nvariants": 50}